<title>UK: Dalgety year profits fall, div maintained.</title>
<headline>Dalgety year profits fall, div maintained.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		20.4		   vs 20.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 13.5		   vs 13.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 22.0		   vs 22.0</p>
<p> Pretax incl exceps     89.6		   vs 93.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,335.2		vs 4,906.6</p>
<p> Operating result	 47.1		   vs 113.6</p>
<p> Exceptional gain	 64.4		   vs nil</p>
<p> Interest payable	 21.9		   vs 19.9</p>
<p> Tax			  30.4		   vs 42.4</p>
<p> Net taxed		  59.2		   vs 51.3</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 12</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 1</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 23</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said profits before exceptionals were 101.9 million stg, down from 127.1 million. The exceptional gain related to the sale of Golden Wonder snacks, Homepride sauces and Dalgety produce.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
